function matchupMetricSummary(person){const parts=[];for(const k of activeMatchupKinds()){const n=k==='shot'?person.shots:k==='touch'?person.touches:k==='cross'?person.crosses:k==='header'?person.headers:person.passes;if(n)parts.push(`${n} ${matchupMetricDefs[k].short.toLowerCase()}`);}return parts.join(' · ')||'No selected activity';}
